# kind|Application|text that the capture must hold|text that it must not hold
# Every Application of the phase carries the managed-by label of
# --enable-managedby-label, so the label proves that Argo CD rendered it
# with the kustomize.buildOptions of the phase.
render|parity-kbuild-alpha-helm|app.kubernetes.io/managed-by: kustomize-v5.8.3|
render|parity-kbuild-alpha-shared|app.kubernetes.io/managed-by: kustomize-v5.8.3|
render|parity-kbuild-alpha-plain|app.kubernetes.io/managed-by: kustomize-v5.8.3|
render|parity-kbuild-alpha-ksops|app.kubernetes.io/managed-by: kustomize-v5.8.3|
